["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"具身智能的“山寨機時代”：親歷2026世界機器人大會，我們的48個觀察-Vol 104 VLA ODM UWB Zero-shot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-cn768a8a-具身智能的山寨机时代-没人赚钱但18家互投/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac5fc3c22c8141af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"腦\"><span class=\"dur\">51:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">腦放電波</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>機器人大會48個觀察：沒人賺錢，18家卻互投36筆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026世界機器人大會的48個觀察：機器人拼裝化、真demo出現、定語通脹；行業沒人賺錢，卻有18家企業投資36筆，本體成本三年降十倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Dylan Patel – Anthropic &amp; OpenAI will have most of the world’s compute by 2028 FLOP RSI hyperscaler crowding-out effect continual learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-dwarkesh-2028-年前两家实验室将控制全球大部分算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/59e51ac2f0c2b285-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>算力正以每年數倍速度向兩家實驗室集中，2028 年它們將控制全球大部分算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">算力正以每年數倍速度向 Anthropic 和 OpenAI 集中，到 2028 年它們將控制全球大部分有效算力，並可能把算力價格推到每兆瓦 5000 萬美元，進而引發主權債務危機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">實驗室經濟學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Return to the Chamber of Mysteries EMC Slot antenna Grounded coplanar waveguide QSFP cage Line (EMC chamber)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-oxide-emc-合规是玄学吗-一次机架级辐射超标排障记/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6b5eb6a03ee5e8af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Oxide and Friends</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>機架輻射超標兩輪無解，解法藏在一場無關會議裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">機架後側 26.565GHz 輻射超標，排查兩輪無果，最終靠一場無關會議上的論文找到解法：在連接器上加吸波材料。這不是玄學，是高頻物理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">EMC</span><span class=\"tag\">硬件工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The New Economics of AI | Martin Casado &amp; Steven Sinofsky Foom TAM in-distribution Mythical man-month expert systems\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-a16z-ai-正在把工程问题变成资本问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>AI 把軟件業從工程約束變成資本約束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Martin Casado 與 Steven Sinofsky 的核心判斷：AI 把軟件業從工程約束變成資本約束——20 人的團隊也能有效花掉 10 億美元，創業公司因此能和巨頭同場競爭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">資本</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Future of AI in the Workplace | Special Episode (Mike Sullivan and Vinay Gidwaney) work genome reducible / irreducible workforce intelligence score amplification score intelligence lock-in PIP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-rationalreminder-ai-时代该由-hr-主导-不是-it-把-ai-当员工雇进来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b9befd958d3d16f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代該由 HR 主導，不是 IT：把 AI 當員工僱進來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把 AI 當技術採購交給 IT，是把主菜當配菜；真正要拆的是任務而不是崗位，該主導這件事的是 HR，因為 AI 沒有感受，而人需要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 落地</span><span class=\"tag\">組織變革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"495 陸大鵬談莎士比亞戲劇與英國歷史的互相影響 intertextuality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-cn2aa250-莎士比亚历史剧是都铎王朝的宣传工具/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>莎士比亞歷史劇是都鐸王朝的宣傳工具</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">莎翁歷史劇歪曲史實極多，本質是都鐸王朝的政治宣傳：醜化理查三世、迴避亨利八世敏感話題，從而鞏固本朝合法性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">莎士比亞</span><span class=\"tag\">英國歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"This Is Why People Hate the Government time tax ordeal mechanism improper payment only-once policy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-ezra-时间税-行政羞辱是穷人恨政府的原因/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>行政羞辱是窮人恨政府的原因：福利申請像一場時間稅</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">政府福利項目中的行政負擔不是效率問題，而是社會控制工具：它用羞辱和文書懲罰窮人，把進步政策變成篩選少數人的漏斗，最終讓受益者恨上政府。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">福利制度</span><span class=\"tag\">行政負擔</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Parallel’s Parag Agrawal: Building a New Web for AI Agents Shapley value grounding fresh index memory hierarchy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-trainingdata-人类点击数据是-bug-agent-搜索重建网络经济/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bca134f7cdc5e5aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">55:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Training Data</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>人類點擊數據是 Bug：Agent 搜索要重做索引與定價</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當搜索的客戶從人變成 Agent，點擊數據失效，索引、定價與商業模式都要重來；Parag 用質量/成本/延遲三角和 Shapley 給出新框架。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent 搜索</span><span class=\"tag\">網絡經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Neil Movva - Making AI 10x Cheaper - [Invest Like the Best, EP.488] KV cache HBM SRAM Tensor Core Harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-ilt-推理成本需降3-6个数量级-后台任务才是主战场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/32e8a839c878b0c2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>後臺Agent將吃掉90%算力，推理優化該為吞吐犧牲延遲</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI推理的下一波不在聊天而在後臺Agent，後者將吃掉90%算力。Sale Research為此優化吞吐而非延遲，甚至接受80%可用性，以換取價格降幾個數量級，並認為Nvidia每瓦優勢被高估。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI推理</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"286: ENCORE: Getting into College with Rick Clark holistic review test-optional Common App FAFSA net price calculator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-asklisa-申请没有万能配方-美国大学录取的反焦虑真相/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ace27132dfc1e3aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">48:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>錄取沒有萬能配方：美國大學申請的反焦慮真相</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">低錄取率只是全國約 80 所名校的敘事；對多數家庭，錄取沒有公式，家長最有用的是固定會議和「控制可控項」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美本申請</span><span class=\"tag\">錄取率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Auschwitz: An SS officer’s photo album Solahütte Counterintelligence Corps Frankfurt Auschwitz Trials\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-witness-纳粹屠夫的私人相册-没有惨状只有蓝莓和假期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>納粹軍官相冊裡沒有暴行，只有藍莓和假期</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一本 SS 軍官私人相冊記錄的並非暴行，而是度假、聚餐和摘藍莓；它證明屠殺者清楚自己在做什麼，也提醒我們理解大屠殺必須看向施害者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大屠殺</span><span class=\"tag\">納粹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"84.49 家央企採買進場，史上最熱WRC：泡沫被擠壓，具身行業進入實戰階段｜14 年從業者的行家鑑別指南 VLA World Model Teleoperation EMG Data Pipeline Post-training\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-lightstar-两万台出货九成吃灰-具身行业进入算roi的实战期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/adbddf5c93cfc63c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"衛\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">漫談Light the Star</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>兩萬臺出貨九成吃灰：具身行業進入算ROI的實戰期</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">WRC的熱浪之下，真正做預訓練的創業公司可能只有一兩家，真實落地需求可能只有出貨量的10%，行業已從秀demo進入算ROI的實戰階段。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How Intel&#x27;s New CPU Finally Makes Sense Fan-out fabric architecture Compute building block Fabric hub UCIe Foveros 3D Direct\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-techtechpotato-下一代-xeon-把宝押在-1-2gb-末级缓存上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc7c90dc34e0b3f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">21:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>Intel 棄用 EMIB 改 UCIe：1.2GB 緩存堆出 256 核</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Diamond Rapids 預計 2027 年發布，最高 256 個 P-core、1.2GB 末級緩存、16 通道 DDR5；用可裁剪的 compute building block 和 UCIe 互連取代 EMIB，大緩存是它對抗 AI 時代的關鍵。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CPU 架構</span><span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"95% of AI Agent Projects Fail to Reach Production. Here&#x27;s Why | Manoj Saxena, TrustWise runtime governance AI control tower guardian agents semantic action layer trust posture management\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-eyeonai-智能体流量首超人类-ai-失控才是落地最大瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b277eb062496b5a5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Eye On A.I.</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>95% 的 AI 智能體項目死在試點：缺的不是智能，是控制層</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 已從內容生成走向自主行動：95% 的 agent 項目困在 pilot，進不了生產，因為缺的不是智能，而是運行時控制層。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能體</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Will Photonics Loosen the Bottlenecks in Neural Systems? WDM (Wavelength Division Multiplexing) Semiconductor Optical Amplifier (SOA) McCulloch-Pitts neuron model Indium Phosphide (InP) Femtojoule per operation TDM (Time Division Multiplexing)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-brainsandmachi-光子计算第三次浪潮-五年内走出实验室-先征服无人机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9151fd6dae1293cb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">45:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Brains and Machines</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>光子計算第三次浪潮：五年內走出實驗室，先征服無人機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">光子不能像電子那樣相互作用，卻能用波長複用實現超大並行和超低延遲。全光學神經網絡五年內有望落地，第一站不是服務器，而是無人機和實時控制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">光子計算</span><span class=\"tag\">神經形態</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Has the Solid State Transformer’s Time Finally Come? Solid State Transformer (SST) IGBT Silicon Carbide (SiC) Galvanic isolation 800VDC architecture PETT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-asianometry-固态变压器吹了五十年-ai数据中心是第一个真买家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a4d5049243d5f237-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>固態變壓器吹了五十年，AI數據中心是第一個真買家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">固態變壓器在海軍、高鐵、智能電網裡試了三次都沒成，因為它只是「更小」,而AI數據中心的銅線和800伏直流問題第一次給了它必須存在的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">電力電子</span><span class=\"tag\">數據中心供電</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"317. Plot Twist: The Second Story Hiding Inside Every Great Pitch pitch gatekeeper auteur\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-thinkfast-好提案藏着两个故事-你的故事和对方升职的故事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fd7a03d438b4365-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Think Fast Talk Smart</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>提案要講兩個故事：一個是項目，一個是對方升職</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">好萊塢編劇 Rhett Reese 揭示提案的本質：表面講項目故事，暗線講對方成功的故事。把對方當主角，降低風險、放大回報，提案成功率大增。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">提案技巧</span><span class=\"tag\">溝通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"365 | Vitor Cardoso on Why Black Holes Are Special no-hair theorem Kerr metric light ring cosmic censorship matched filtering last parsec problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-mindscape-黑洞只有两个参数-形成机制却仍是谜/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>黑洞只有兩個參數，形成機制卻仍是謎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">引力波與 EHT 確認黑洞確實只有兩個參數，但 120 倍太陽質量的黑洞如何形成、暗物質是否由微型黑洞構成、最後 1 秒差距如何跨越，都是未解之謎。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span><span class=\"tag\">引力波</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Are We Alone? Cosmic Loneliness and the Longing to Believe (with Adam Kirsch) UAP euphemism treadmill book experience Drake equation AATIP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-econtalk-所有外星人想象都是人类的自画像/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>UFO 熱潮不是天文問題，是信仰問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當證據停留在證詞，宇宙是否擁擠就成了信仰問題。科學越進步，地外生命在觀測裡越稀有；我們談論UFO時，真正在談的其實是自己。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">UFO</span><span class=\"tag\">外星生命</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Why Medical AI Needs a Referee | Protege&#x27;s Engy Ziedan evals misalignment subnode harness value-based purchasing hedonics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-a16z-医疗-ai-考满分也进不了医院-缺一个独立裁判/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">35:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>醫療 AI 考滿分也進不了醫院：缺一個獨立裁判</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型能答對幾千道醫學題，卻可能在一個真實臨床任務上只有 45% 的正確率。問題不在模型不夠聰明，而在沒人獨立地、持續地測它在真實場景裡到底行不行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">評測</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Kidneys for sale repugnant transaction market design non-directed donor\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-grayarea-禁止卖肾的代价-本不该失去的生命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c8b1deddea1e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>禁賣腎的代價：每年 13 萬新症，移植不足 3 萬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國每年 13 萬新腎衰病例、移植不足 3 萬，Al Roth 拆解器官買賣的「反感」來源，論證有監管的補償能救命且避免剝削。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">腎臟移植</span><span class=\"tag\">器官買賣</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"How to Improve Motivation &amp; Overcome Procrastination | Dr. Masud Husain apathy basal ganglia activation energy wanting vs liking\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-huberman-动机不是欲望问题-而是激活能量障碍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d9e03163dcfb779e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">2:20:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>拖延不是懶，是大腦覺得太費勁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">神經科醫生 Masud Husain 用病例和腦成像證明：拖延和冷漠源於感知到的努力成本過高，而非缺乏慾望。降低激活能量、提前規劃、分解任務，是繞過障礙的實用策略。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">動機</span><span class=\"tag\">拖延</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Nigerian Industrial Behemoth That Could Reshape the African Economy flying geese paradigm resource curse developmental state kulak demonstration effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-oddlots-非洲工业化不缺资源-缺的是人口密度/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">58:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>非洲不缺資源，缺的是人口密度</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dangote靠壟斷特許起家，自掏200億美元建成尼日利亞煉油廠併成為非洲首富，但Studwell認為決定非洲能否複製亞洲奇蹟的關鍵變量是人口密度帶來的城市市場規模，而不是礦產資源或援助。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">非洲經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">產業政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Uruguay&#x27;s water referendum concession mate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-witness-供水私有化不是宿命-乌拉圭公投的水权胜利/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>供水私有化不是宿命：烏拉圭公投的水權勝利</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2004年10月31日，烏拉圭人以64.7%的贊成票把「水是生命必需資源」寫入憲法，並規定供水只能由國家提供，成為世界第一個用憲法鎖死供水私有化的國家。那場運動的起點，是一處海濱城市的水龍頭被關閉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">水權</span><span class=\"tag\">公投</span>\n</div></div></a>"]